OL,3,GNEWSADerelict centre to be transformed
OL,4,Ainto SEND school
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dilapidated school building in
OL,7,FScunthorpe will be transformed into a
OL,8,Fspecialist school and is set to open
OL,9,Fnext year.
OL,11,FThe former Darley Centre has been empty
OL,12,Ffor eight years, and has been bought by
OL,13,Fspecialist educational needs and
OL,14,Fdisabilities (SEND) provider Polaris
OL,15,FCommunity.
OL,17,FOnce renovated, it will offer 42 places
OL,18,Ffor children aged between five and 18
OL,19,Fwith SEND and social, emotional and
OL,20,Fmental health (SEMH) needs.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
