OL,3,GNEWSADerelict centre to be transformed
OL,4,Ainto SEND school
OL,5,
OL,6,FExecutive head teacher Derek Fance said
OL,7,Fit would mean "children have access to
OL,8,Fan appropriate education, as many
OL,9,Fmainstream provisions can't offer that
OL,10,Fvery specialist care that some children
OL,11,Fneed".
